    <div class="prose">
      <p>If you find yourself doubting your worth, being overly self-critical, or feeling that you are somehow not enough, counselling can help. Together we can explore where these feelings come from and begin to develop a kinder, more compassionate relationship with yourself.</p>
      <p>Low self esteem often has deep roots — in early experiences, relationships, or messages we absorbed about ourselves a long time ago. Understanding those roots can be the first step to changing how you see and feel about yourself.</p>
      <p>This work takes time, but it is some of the most meaningful and lasting change that counselling can bring about.</p>
